      <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/guides">Guides</a> / <span>Java Android Development</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>Java Android Development on a Phone</h1>
      <p class="lead">Keep activities modular, XML layouts clean, and dependencies minimal for fast mobile builds.</p>
      <p>
        Standard Android Java projects separate logic inside <code>src/main/java/</code> from declarative
        views inside <code>src/main/res/layout/</code>. Keeping dependency trees lean shortens Gradle
        resolution times and reduces mobile memory pressure.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
